          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I nino meno ginapita ma Rwot omiyo olot odoŋo bibedo maber kun bene noŋo tye ki deyone; gin mucek i lobo bimiyo jo Icrael mubwot gibiwakke kun bene noŋo gitye ki deyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo mudoŋ i Cion ki jo ma pud bedo! Jerucalem gibilwoŋo ni jo maleŋ, jo ducu ma doŋ gicoyo nyiŋgi ni myero gubed kwo i Jerucalem, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "i kare ma noŋo Rwot doŋ olwoko cilo ki i kom mon me Cion woko, kun bene doŋ noŋo otyeko lonyo remo woko i dye Jerucalem pi cwiny me ŋolo kop atir ki cwiny me waŋo gin marac woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
